+/* Copyright (c) 2015-2017 The Khronos Group Inc.
+ * Copyright (c) 2015-2017 Valve Corporation
+ * Copyright (c) 2015-2017 LunarG, Inc.
+ * Copyright (C) 2015-2017 Google Inc.
